  strudelCode: "-- Simple Strudel Demo Code\n-- This demonstrates basic pattern syntax\n\n--
    Define instruments\npiano = sound \"piano\" | n \"c4 d4 e4 f4 g4 a4 b4 c5\" |
    # gain 0.8\nbass = sound \"bass\" | n \"c2 g2 a2 g2\" | # gain 1.0\ndrums = sound
    \"drum\" | n \"c2 ~ d2 ~\" | # gain 1.2\n\n-- Create patterns\nmelody = slow
    2 $ piano\nbassline = fast 2 $ bass\nbeat = drums\n\n-- Combine patterns\nmainPattern
    = stack [\n  melody,\n  bassline,\n  beat\n]\n\n-- Play the pattern\nmainPattern"
